<title>ITALY: Olivetti to retry bourse start in an hour.</title>
<headline>Olivetti to retry bourse start in an hour.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian information technology group Olivetti's shares will attempt to reopen at 1042 local time (0842 GMT), the stock market council said.</p>
<p>Olivetti shares were quoted at 620 lire per share in pre-bourse trade, lower than a 10 percent trading fluctuation limit. Because of this the share could not start trading at the normal opening time.</p>
<p>The share was suspended on Thursday and Friday at 749 lire.</p>
</text>
